    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to 65 Drumnigh Manor a truly magnificent 5 bedroom semi detached property in the much sought after Drumnigh Manor development. Built in 2022 this energy efficient property is presented in turnkey condition with an abundance of high end fittings and fixtures and the added bonus of a sunny west facing aspect. The foot -bridge connecting Drumnigh Manor to St Marnocks Bay is now open providing easy and safe access to all that Portmarnock Village has to offer…\r\n\r\nUpon entering, you're welcomed by a generous entrance hall featuring a large guest wc, a stylish lounge enhanced by a custom built in tv display unit with LED lighting, a modern open-plan kitchen/dining/family area complete with designer kitchen units by Nolans, exquisite Italian Quartz countertops, two ovens, feature splashback and a large utility room. \r\n\r\nOutside there is a low maintenance sun drenched west facing garden which is has a mix of patio and lawn with a large shed, tap and sockets. Upstairs offers 5 well proportioned bedrooms including two en suites, family bathroom and an abundance of fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nLocated in Portmarnock this property is close to whole host of local amenities including Lidl, stunning coastal walks on the Portmarnock/Baldoyle coastline and numerous coffee shops. Transport links are easily accessible with Portmarnock Dart Station near by and motorways such as the M1 & M50 are easily accessible."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall\t           1.16 x 7\tDecorative timber floor, alarm, radiator cover\r\n \r\nGuest Wc\t  1.57 x 1.5      \tTiled floor, part tiled wall, feature wall panelling, heated rail, w.c, w.h.b\r\n \r\nLiving Room / lounge\t   3.87 x 4.8\tDecorative timber floor, fitted built-in tv display unit with storage & LED lighting, radiator cover \r\n\t\t\r\nKitchen / Dining area\t  5.3 x 5.03\tDecorative timber floor, fully fitted kitchen, Waterfall Quartz worktop, large kitchen island unit, designer mirrored glass splashback, shelving, spotlights, two full ovens, built-in microwave, fridge/freezer, dishwasher, hob, extractor fan, double doors to garden\r\n\t\t\r\nUtility Room   \t1.75 x 2.66\tDecorative timber floor, plumbed for washer & dryer with fitted units for additional storage \r\n\r\nStairs / Landing\t\tCarpeted, large storage closet with shelving\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 \t4.3 x 3      Double fitted wardrobes, decorative timber floor, tv point\r\n\r\nEn suite    \t1.8 x 1.76\tTiled floor & partially tiled walls, walk in shower, mirror, w.c, w.h.b, heated rail, built-in shelving\r\n\r\nFamily bathroom\t2.36 x 1.94\tTiled floor & partially tiled walls, bath suite with handheld shower, mirror, w.c, w.h.b, heated rail\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\t       3.03 x 2.18            Decorative timber floor, fitted wardrobe, black out blinds\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\t        2.9 x 4.16\tDecorative timber floor, fitted wardrobe\r\n\r\nLanding\t\t  Stira access to fully floored attic\r\n\r\nBedroom 5 / Study\t    4 x 5.08\tVelux windows with black out blinds, feature sloped ceiling, decorative timber floor  \r\n\r\nMaster bedroom\t5.05 x 4.15\tDecorative timber floor, feature sloped ceiling, abundance of fitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nEn Suite\t             2.9 x 2.87\tTiled floor & partially tiled walls, walk in shower with waterfall shower head, heated rail, w.c, w.h.b.\r\n \r\nRear garden\t\tWalled & fenced, sockets, tap, large shed with electrics, sunny west facing, side passage, patio, lighting"
